cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this reanalysis, please cite the original paper (below) and this archive."
title: "appalachian-sar: data and reanalysis for Stout, Jessee & McMeen (2025), nested and island species-area models for southern Appalachian amphibians"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Stout
    given-names: Jeremy B.
  - family-names: Jessee
    given-names: Lance D.
  - family-names: McMeen
    given-names: John N.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-8141-567X"
abstract: >-
  Data and analyses from Stout, Jessee & McMeen (2025): nested (7 areas) and
  island (26 sites) species-area models for southern Appalachian amphibians,
  frogs and salamanders, reproduced with the original log-linear regression
  and refit by nonlinear least squares with the sars Python package,
  including multi-model comparison, model averaging, bootstrap intervals and
  threshold analysis.
version: 1.0.0
